The Swift symbol demangler
(decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/src/analyzers/demangle/kuna_swift) follows
the Swift project's reference demangler
(https://github.com/apple/swift, swift/lib/Demangling/Demangler.cpp and
NodePrinter.cpp, with the node vocabulary of DemangleNodes.def and the
mangling grammar of docs/ABI/Mangling.rst). It is a fresh Rust
implementation of that design, not a line-for-line translation. The Swift
project is released under the Apache License, Version 2.0, with the Runtime
Library Exception:

